    "posts": [
      {
        "id": 6003,
        "name": "btabrisky",
        "username": "btabrisky",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-19T16:44:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It seems to me that a hero can have 2 copies of the same equipment card in play, as long as the cards don’t say “Limited” on them. My question then is does the hero receive benefits from each card? For example, if Wraith has 2 copies of Mega-computer out is each instance of damage directed at her from the environment reduced by 2?</p>\n<p>Thanks, Bill</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:49.155Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 6001,
        "topic_slug": "multiple-copies-of-equipment-card-in-play",
        "display_username": "btabrisky",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
